    "title_en": "Magnetohydrodynamic spectra and line invariants in the presence of axions",
    "abstract_en": "A new form of the mean-field equations for magnetic fields, which accounts for the interaction with axions, is studied. It is shown that the asymptotic ergodic invariants of magnetic field lines play a key role in the evolution of magnetic fields, which determine the type of the magnetohydrodynamic spectrum of the solutions.",
